  "body": "Vacant, freehold and ready to go - this modern two-bedroom townhouse is a seriously appealing opportunity in ever-popular Silverdale. Whether you're making your first move onto the property ladder, looking to downsize without compromise, or adding a smart investment to your portfolio, this is a home that delivers on simplicity, convenience and value.\r\n\r\nDesigned for easy modern living, the layout is practical with open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces flowing effortlessly outdoors. The private, covered entertaining area adds another layer of versatility - ideal for summer barbecues, morning coffees or simply enjoying your own space. A heat pump keeps the home comfortable year-round, while the low-maintenance construction means there's more time to enjoy life and less time worrying about upkeep.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Silverdale's ever-growing lifestyle hub, you're close to shops, cafés, parks, schools, motorway connections and the beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches. The property is also zoned for Silverdale Primary School and Orewa College, adding further appeal for families looking to secure a home in a popular school zone. With everything from everyday essentials to weekend adventures within easy reach, the location is every bit as appealing as the home itself.\r\n\r\nFEATURES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n\r\n• Freehold title\r\n• Vacant and ready for immediate possession\r\n• Two-bedroom modern townhouse\r\n• Private covered outdoor entertaining area\r\n• Rainwater collection tank connected to the laundry for non-potable use\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n• Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n• Modern, low-maintenance construction\r\n• Off-street parking\r\n\r\nLow-maintenance, modern and ready to go - this is an opportunity you'll want to see for yourself. Be quick.\r\n\r\n#millwater #silverdale #milldale #orewa #redbeach #whangaparaoa",
